---
// src/components/sections/FAQ.astro
// 5 benefit-angled Q&A. Each question targets a specific audience
// (SME owner / individual / corporate HR / real estate / decision maker)
// and each answer leads with the concrete benefit.

export interface Props { locale: 'en' | 'zh'; }
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const isZh = locale === 'zh';

const faqs = isZh ? [
  { q: '培训后我的团队每周能真正省下多少时间?', a: '大多数团队在第一个月内每周节省 10 小时以上。最大的时间节省来自:研究(NotebookLM 替代 2-3 小时的阅读和总结)、内容创作(Canva AI + Gemini 把社交/起草时间缩短 60-70%)、会议跟进(Gemini 把 1 小时会议变成 5 个要点,只需 30 秒)。我们留下的 5 任务行动计划,目标就是第一周就锁定 10 小时。' },
  { q: '5 小时后,我个人能做哪些今天做不了的事?', a: '您会带走 5 项具体成果,下周一就能用:(1) 10 个日常工作的 AI 提示模板,(2) 调校好您个人风格的 AI 助手(Gemini Gem),(3) 可重复使用的 Canva 模板,(4) 用您自己内容搭建的 Gamma 演示,(5) 下周的 5 任务 AI 行动计划。没有任何虚的——所有内容都在课堂上完成并测试,不是"事后发 PPT"。' },
  { q: '我的公司可以通过 HRDCorp 拿回多少钱?投资回报如何?', a: '5 小时企业内训(最多 20 人)成本为 RM 6,000–RM 12,000。已注册 HRDCorp 的公司通常可以在提交完整申请后 30–45 个工作天内拿回 80–100%。以 3 人营销团队为例,每周节省 10 小时,仅释放的时间价值就超过 RM 13,000/人/年——培训不到 6 周就回本,这还没算 HRDCorp 报销的部分。' },
  { q: '我能同时拿到 5 LPPEH CPD 学时,又让公司报销 HRDCorp 吗?', a: '可以——这是马来西亚房地产市场最少被使用的优势之一。Mastering AI 工作坊同时获得 LPPEH 认可(您可在年度续期中拿到 5 CPD 学时)和 HRDCorp 可报销(您的公司能拿回大部分或全部费用)。参加过的经纪人用这次培训:(a) 完成年度 CPD 要求,(b) 拿到一个每天都用的生产力工具,(c) 一天之内为公司节省 RM 5,000+。' },
  { q: '这个 5 小时工作坊和我团队已经看过的免费 AI 网络研讨会有什么不同?', a: '网络研讨会教概念。这个工作坊建立您团队周一要用的工作流。每位参与者离开时都拥有:自己搭建的 AI 助手、自己保存的提示模板、自己设计的 Canva 模板、自己写的行动计划。PPT 就是成果,不会"事后发"。这是"看烹饪节目"和"真的做饭"的区别——往届学员一致认为这是一年中最有用的一天培训。' },
] : [
  { q: 'How much time will my team actually save per week after this training?', a: 'Teams typically reclaim 10+ hours per week within the first month. The biggest time savings come from research (NotebookLM replaces 2-3 hours of reading and summarising), content creation (Canva AI + Gemini cut social and drafting time by 60-70%), and meeting follow-ups (Gemini turns a 1-hour meeting into 5 bullet points in 30 seconds). The 5-task action plan we leave you with is designed to lock in 10 hours in week one.' },
  { q: 'What will I personally be able to do after 5 hours that I can\'t do today?', a: 'You leave with 5 tangible deliverables you can use the next Monday: (1) 10 copy-paste prompt templates for your daily work, (2) a personal AI assistant (Gemini Gem) tuned to your voice, (3) a Canva template ready to reuse for social posts, (4) a Gamma presentation built from your own content, (5) a written 5-task action plan for the week ahead. No "we\'ll send the slides after" — the slide IS the deliverable.' },
  { q: 'How much can my company claim back through HRDCorp, and what\'s the ROI?', a: 'A typical 5-hour in-house workshop for up to 20 participants costs RM 6,000–RM 12,000. HRDCorp-registered companies can typically claim back 80–100% within 30–45 working days of filing a clean claim. On a 3-person marketing team saving 10 hours/week each, the freed time alone is worth RM 13,000+ per marketer per year — the training pays back in under 6 weeks, even before the HRDCorp claim lands.' },
  { q: 'Can I earn my 5 LPPEH CPD Hours AND have my agency claim HRDCorp at the same time?', a: 'Yes — and this is one of the most under-used wins in the Malaysian real estate market. The Mastering AI workshop is both LPPEH-approved (5 CPD Hours on your renewal record) AND HRDCorp-claimable (your agency recovers most or all of the fee). Past attendees have used it to (a) tick their annual CPD box, (b) get a productivity tool they actually use daily, and (c) save their firm RM 5,000+ in a single day.' },
  { q: 'How is this 5-hour workshop different from the free AI webinars my team has already watched?', a: 'Webinars teach concepts. This workshop builds the workflow your team will use on Monday. Every participant leaves with their own AI assistant built, their own prompt templates saved, their own Canva template designed, and their own action plan written. No "we\'ll send you the slides later" — the slide IS the deliverable. It is the difference between watching a cooking show and cooking the meal. That\'s why past attendees consistently call it the most useful training day of their year.' },
];
---

<section class="section" id="faq-section">
  <div class="container-narrow">
    <div style="text-align: center; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 48px;">
      <span class="badge badge--outlined" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">{isZh ? '常见问题' : 'FAQ'}</span>
      <h2 style="margin: 0 0 12px;">{isZh ? '常见问题' : 'Frequently asked'}</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-list" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--border);">
      {faqs.map((faq, i) => (
        <details class="faq-item" open={i === 0} style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 20px 0;">
          <summary style="cursor: pointer; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: start; gap: 16px;">
            <span style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.125rem; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.4;">{faq.q}</span>
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" style="flex-shrink: 0; transition: transform 200ms ease;" class="faq-chevron">
              <path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            </svg>
          </summary>
          <p style="margin: 16px 0 0; color: var(--muted-foreground); line-height: 1.6;">{faq.a}</p>
        </details>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 48px;">
      <p style="color: var(--muted-foreground); margin-bottom: 16px;">{isZh ? '还有问题?' : 'Still have questions?'}</p>
      <a href="https://wa.me/60163356790" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn--secondary">
        {isZh ? 'WhatsApp 我' : 'WhatsApp me'}
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script is:inline>
  document.querySelectorAll('.faq-item').forEach(item => {
    item.addEventListener('toggle', () => {
      const chevron = item.querySelector('.faq-chevron');
      if (chevron) chevron.style.transform = item.open ? 'rotate(180deg)' : 'rotate(0deg)';
    });
  });
</script>
